{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c20513c-db0e-11ef-8241-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c1dc752-db0e-11ef-9ac7-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"果","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"雞山","place_name_jianti_auto":"鸡山","place_note":"四川营山县境","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c4bcecf0-db0e-11ef-a657-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蓬","place_name_jianti_auto":"蓬","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"c4bcecf1-db0e-11ef-a096-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"果","place_name_jianti_auto":"果","place_note":"四川南充","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"c4bcecf2-db0e-11ef-953f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"三川","place_name_jianti_auto":"三川","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"c4bcecf3-db0e-11ef-b254-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"三川","place_name_jianti_auto":"三川","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"c4bcecf4-db0e-11ef-8e0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東","place_name_jianti_auto":"东","place_note":"四川省东北部","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"c4bcecf5-db0e-11ef-8cf3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西川","place_name_jianti_auto":"西川","place_note":"四川省中部","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"c4bcecf6-db0e-11ef-b9d2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"山南西道","place_name_jianti_auto":"山南西道","place_note":"陕西省南部","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"c4bcecf7-db0e-11ef-8879-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"雞山在蓬、果二州之界，而羣盜依阻以寇掠三川，則其結根也廣矣。三川，謂東、西川及山南西道也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"鸡山在蓬、果二州之界，而群盗依阻以寇掠三川，则其结根也广矣。三川，谓东、西川及山南西道也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"c4bcecef-db0e-11ef-ae1f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"果","place_name_jianti_auto":"果","place_note":"四川南充","resolved_place_entity_id":1826,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c4bcecf9-db0e-11ef-b765-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、夔州府（卷六十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"其相连者曰八面山。山形秀整，望之八面皆方，因名。○五诰山...","context_before":"...五支，如鸡距然。亦曰鸡山。《唐志》：鸡山接蓬、果二州界。","source_end_index":91,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8bd3efa0-6ed9-53eb-890e-2638e73de13c","source_start_index":45,"source_text":"大中五年，蓬果群盗依阻鸡山，寇掠三川，果州刺史王贽弘讨平之。三川，谓东、西两川及山南西道也。"}],"path":"四川方舆纪要/四、夔州府（卷六十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"11蓬、果羣盜依阻雞山，寇掠三川；以果州刺史王贄弘充三川行營都知兵馬使以討之。","content_fanyi":"蓬州、果州的群盗凭借鸡山的险阻，在三川等地抢掠；朝廷任命果州刺史王贽弘担任三川行营都知兵马使，率兵前往讨伐他们。","content_jianti_auto":"11蓬、果群盗依阻鸡山，寇掠三川；以果州刺史王贽弘充三川行营都知兵马使以讨之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":25375,"number":11,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百四十九 (唐紀六十五) / 宣宗元聖至明成武獻文睿智章仁神聰懿道大孝皇帝下 / 五年 / 第 13 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"c4bcecee-db0e-11ef-aa8a-a0d3651f611f","year_int":851},"tongjian_id":"c4bcecee-db0e-11ef-aa8a-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"果","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：舊紀在七月癸未。今從實錄、新紀。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：旧纪在七月癸未。今从实录、新纪。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"c735e44f-db0e-11ef-9c8e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"果","place_name_jianti_auto":"果","place_note":"四川省南充市","resolved_place_entity_id":1826,"start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"c735e45d-db0e-11ef-a623-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/六、唐下 五代九国附（卷六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"明年，合静难兵犯阙[静难帅王行瑜，初为叛帅朱玫将，斩玫来...","context_before":"...既而顺命。驾还凤翔，昌符复作乱，败奔陇州，茂贞击平之]。","source_end_index":249,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"32306303-39ab-51df-9f29-6ed7910c8100","source_start_index":171,"source_text":"景福初，并有山南西道[时兴元帅杨守亮谋拒命，茂贞擅举兵攻之，克凤州及兴、洋二州，进拔兴元，请镇其地，诏授茂贞山南西道，兼领武定。茂贞欲并得凤翔，遂不奉诏]。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/六、唐下 五代九国附（卷六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"3鳳翔節度使李茂貞自請鎭興元，詔以茂貞爲山南西道兼武定節度使，以中書侍郞、同平章事徐彥若同平章事，充鳳翔節度使，又割果、閬二州隸武定軍。茂貞欲兼得鳳翔，不奉詔。","content_fanyi":"凤翔节度使李茂贞自行要求到兴元去镇守，唐昭宗下诏，让李茂贞担任山南西道兼武定节度使；又让中书侍郎、同平章事徐彦若仍带同平章事官衔，充任凤翔节度使，并将果州、阆州二州改划给武定军。李茂贞想要同时握有凤翔，所以不肯接受诏命。","content_jianti_auto":"3凤翔节度使李茂贞自请镇兴元，诏以茂贞为山南西道兼武定节度使，以中书侍郞、同平章事徐彦若同平章事，充凤翔节度使，又割果、阆二州隶武定军。茂贞欲兼得凤翔，不奉诏。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":26690,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百五十九 (唐紀七十五) / 昭宗聖穆景文孝皇帝上之中 / 二年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"c735e44e-db0e-11ef-a873-a0d3651f611f","year_int":893},"tongjian_id":"c735e44e-db0e-11ef-a873-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"果","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"forward_setup","source_end_index":15,"source_start_index":7,"source_text":"爲李仁矩敗沒張本","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"cbf869b2-db0e-11ef-bfab-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"李仁矩","people_name_jianti_auto":"李仁矩","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"cbdf98f6-db0e-11ef-b84f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李仁矩","people_name_jianti_auto":"李仁矩","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"cbdf98f7-db0e-11ef-ad68-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"兩川","place_name_jianti_auto":"两川","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"cbdf98f8-db0e-11ef-9c0f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"五代","place_name_jianti_auto":"五代","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"cbdf98f9-db0e-11ef-abc6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"欲以制兩川也。爲李仁矩敗沒張本。按職官分紀，五代有內客省使、客省使、副使，各一官。通鑑於天成二年三月書客省使李仁矩，今書內客省使，豈自客省使陞爲內客省使邪？","note_content_jianti_auto":"欲以制两川也。为李仁矩败没张本。按职官分纪，五代有内客省使、客省使、副使，各一官。通鉴于天成二年三月书客省使李仁矩，今书内客省使，岂自客省使升为内客省使邪？","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"cbdf98f5-db0e-11ef-8faf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"果","place_name_jianti_auto":"果","place_note":"四川省南充市","resolved_place_entity_id":1826,"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"cbdf98fe-db0e-11ef-853d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"30辛亥，割閬、果二州置保寧軍，壬子，以內客省使李仁矩爲節度使。","content_fanyi":"十月十六日辛亥，朝廷划出阆、果二州，设置保宁军。十月十七日壬子，任命内客省使李仁矩为节度使。","content_jianti_auto":"30辛亥，割阆、果二州置保宁军，壬子，以内客省使李仁矩为节度使。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":28784,"number":30,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百七十六 (後唐紀五) / 明宗聖德和武欽孝皇帝中之上 / 四年 / 第 31 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"cbdf98f4-db0e-11ef-9db9-a0d3651f611f","year_int":929},"tongjian_id":"cbdf98f4-db0e-11ef-9db9-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"果","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links