:"cbfd0e83-db0e-11ef-ba90-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"徧考隋·唐·地理志、五代·職方考、元豐九域志，皆無徵州。按東川之兵時自遂、閬東略，九域志，合州在遂州東二百二十里，果州在遂州東南一百八十里，巴州在閬州東二百四十五里，蓬州在果州東北一百八十五里；徵州必在遂、合、果三州之間。","note_content_jianti_auto":"徧考隋·唐·地理志、五代·职方考、元丰九域志，皆无征州。按东川之兵时自遂、阆东略，九域志，合州在遂州东二百二十里，果州在遂州东南一百八十里，巴州在阆州东二百四十五里，蓬州在果州东北一百八十五里；征州必在遂、合、果三州之间。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"cbfd0e73-db0e-11ef-8ccf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"果","place_name_jianti_auto":"果","place_note":"四川省南充市","resolved_place_entity_id":1826,"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"cbfd0e8d-db0e-11ef-b12b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"癸丑，東川兵陷徵、合、巴、蓬、果五州。","content_fanyi":"十月二十三日癸丑，东川兵攻陷征、合、巴、蓬、果五州。","content_jianti_auto":"癸丑，东川兵陷征、合、巴、蓬、果五州。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":28845,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百七十七 (後唐紀六) / 明宗聖德和武欽孝皇帝中之下 / 長興元年 / 第 54 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"cbfd0e72-db0e-11ef-9d5d-a0d3651f611f","year_int":930},"tongjian_id":"cbfd0e72-db0e-11ef-9d5d-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"果","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"成都","place_name_jianti_auto":"成都","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"cc064681-db0e-11ef-8eef-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"引還成都。","note_content_jianti_auto":"引还成都。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"cc064680-db0e-11ef-81b9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"果","place_name_jianti_auto":"果","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"cc064683-db0e-11ef-ba50-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"閬","place_name_jianti_auto":"阆","place_note":"四川省阆中市","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"cc064684-db0e-11ef-928f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"果、閬，二州名。","note_content_jianti_auto":"果、阆，二州名。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"cc064682-db0e-11ef-89ba-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"果","place_name_jianti_auto":"果","place_note":"四川省南充市","resolved_place_entity_id":1826,"start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"cc06468b-db0e-11ef-9b78-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"10乙巳，趙廷隱、李肇自劍州引還，留兵五千戍利州。丙午，董璋亦還東川，留兵三千戍果、閬。","content_fanyi":"二月十七日乙巳，赵廷隐、李肇从剑州率领军队返回成都，留下五千名士兵驻守利州。二月十八日丙午，董璋也返回东川，留下三千名士兵驻守果州、阆州。","content_jianti_auto":"10乙巳，赵廷隐、李肇自剑州引还，留兵五千戍利州。丙午，董璋亦还东川，留兵三千戍果、阆。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":28876,"number":10,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百七十七 (後唐紀六) / 明宗聖德和武欽孝皇帝中之下 / 二年 / 第 12 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"cc06467f-db0e-11ef-88c4-a0d3651f611f","year_int":931},"tongjian_id":"cc06467f-db0e-11ef-88c4-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":5},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"果","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"董璋","people_name_jianti_auto":"董璋","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"cc18d3b5-db0e-11ef-baae-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孟知祥","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟知祥","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"cc18d3b6-db0e-11ef-a30e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"趙廷隱","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵廷隐","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"cc18d3b7-db0e-11ef-85f4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"閬州","place_name_jianti_auto":"阆州","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"cc18d3b8-db0e-11ef-bd5d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"保寧軍","place_name_jianti_auto":"保宁军","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"cc18d3b9-db0e-11ef-bbe8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"董璋取閬州，廢保寧軍；今孟知祥復以爲節鎭，以賞趙廷隱。","note_content_jianti_auto":"董璋取阆州，废保宁军；今孟知祥复以为节镇，以赏赵廷隐。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":99,"tongjian_id":"cc18d3b4-db0e-11ef-85e9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"果","place_name_jianti_auto":"果","place_note":"四川南充市","resolved_place_entity_id":1826,"start_index":101,"tongjian_id":"cc18d3d0-db0e-11ef-8f1f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、保宁府（卷六十八）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"宋仍曰阆州[亦曰阆中郡]。乾德四年，改军号曰安德军。元初...","context_before":"...，置保宁军，领阆、果二州。长兴初，董璋叛，陷阆州，军废。","source_end_index":451,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"df647719-2b47-5ed8-9d8e-412a659fe0fb","source_start_index":423,"source_text":"三年，知祥并东川，复置保宁节度，兼领果、蓬、渠、开四州。"}],"path":"四川方舆纪要/二、保宁府（卷六十八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"知祥謂李昊曰：「吾得東川，爲患益深。」昊請其故，知祥曰：「自吾發梓州，得仁罕七狀，皆云『公宜自領東川，不然諸將不服。』廷隱言『本不敢當東川，因仁罕不讓，遂有爭心耳。』君爲我曉廷隱，復以閬州爲保寧軍，益以果、蓬、渠、開四州，往鎭之。吾自領東川，以絕仁罕之望。」廷隱猶不平，請與仁罕鬬，勝者爲東川；昊深解之，乃受命。六月，以廷隱爲保寧留後。戊午，趙季良帥將吏請知祥兼鎭東川，許之。季良等又請知祥稱王，權行制書，賞功臣，不許。","content_fanyi":"孟知祥对李昊说：“我得到东川以后，祸患反而更深了。”李昊询问缘故。孟知祥说：“自从我离开梓州，先后收到李仁罕七次上书，都说‘您应当亲自兼领东川，不然众将不会心服。’赵廷隐则说‘我本来不敢承当东川的职务，只因李仁罕不肯相让，才生出争夺之心。’你替我开导赵廷隐，说明将把阆州恢复为保宁军，并把果、蓬、渠、开四州增划给它，让他前往镇守。我亲自兼领东川，以断绝李仁罕的指望。”赵廷隐仍然愤愤不平，请求与李仁罕决斗，胜者获得东川；李昊深入劝解，他才接受命令。六月，朝廷任命赵廷隐为保宁留后。戊午日，赵季良率领将吏请求孟知祥兼镇东川，孟知祥答应了。赵季良等人又请求孟知祥称王，暂以王的名义颁行制书、赏赐功臣，孟知祥没有同意。","content_jianti_auto":"知祥谓李昊曰：「吾得东川，为患益深。」昊请其故，知祥曰：「自吾发梓州，得仁罕七状，皆云『公宜自领东川，不然诸将不服。』廷隐言『本不敢当东川，因仁罕不让，遂有争心耳。』君为我晓廷隐，复以阆州为保宁军，益以果、蓬、渠、开四州，往镇之。吾自领东川，以绝仁罕之望。」廷隐犹不平，请与仁罕鬬，胜者为东川；昊深解之，乃受命。六月，以廷隐为保宁留后。戊午，赵季良帅将吏请知祥兼镇东川，许之。季良等又请知祥称王，权行制书，赏功臣，不许。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":28950,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百七十七 (後唐紀六) / 明宗聖德和武欽孝皇帝中之下 / 三年 / 第 29 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"cc18d3b2-db0e-11ef-9f69-a0d3651f611f","year_int":932},"tongjian_id":"cc18d3b2-db0e-11ef-9f69-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":6},"place_name":"果"},"message":"success","success":true}